out/
release/
dist/
.venv-build/
resources/bin/
# Engineering process, deliberately not published: agent instructions, prompt docs and the
# planning/handoff notes. The architecture they describe is published as ARCHITECTURE.md instead.
.cursor/
AGENTS.md
SETUP.md
docs/
Source Codes/
# Local verification secrets. Never commit an API key: git history is permanent and a key
# pushed once must be treated as burned even if the next commit removes it.
.secrets/
*.local.json
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.vite/
build/python/
# Probe scratch: generated media fixtures and, after a re-freeze, a copy of the previous
# engine binary. Large, regenerable, and never part of a build. Covered by a pattern rather
# than by name because each probe makes its own, and they are normally deleted on success —
# so the one that survives is the one whose probe crashed, which is exactly when nobody is
# thinking about .gitignore.
.tmp-*/
